Mutant: the index file of the segment read counts as the next one. Must fail: a reader that starts in a later segment waits for its first index record.
Apply from the repository root with git apply, and never commit it applied.

--- a/src/bin/pgcopydb/ld_spool.c
+++ b/src/bin/pgcopydb/ld_spool.c
@@ -2210,7 +2210,7 @@
 
 	sformat(path, sizeof(path), "%s/%016" PRIX64 ".idx", reader->dirname, seq);
 
-	return seq != reader->segment && file_exists(path);
+	return file_exists(path);
 }
 
 
